        <UserObject label="D01 Handheld gripper body" tooltip="What does the operator hold, so that handheld and robot camera images match? Accepted 2026-10-19 as the printed copy (approved proposal); reopened at the supervisor meeting on 2026-11-03 with the real Dex1-1 as the alternative.&#xa;&#xa;Source: Decisions/D01; msc-thesis docs/proposal.md §1; Daily 2026-11-03" detail="What does the operator hold, so that handheld and robot camera images match? Accepted 2026-10-19 as the printed copy (approved proposal); reopened at the supervisor meeting on 2026-11-03 with the real Dex1-1 as the alternative." source="Decisions/D01; msc-thesis docs/proposal.md §1; Daily 2026-11-03" status="" id="n0">
