        <UserObject label="Trigger → PC → RS-485 → gripper" tooltip="PICO trigger → recording PC → rt/dex1/&lt;side&gt;/cmd → dex1_1_service → USB → RS-485-to-USB board → gripper. Proportional or binary mapping is a software choice; both to be tested.&#xa;&#xa;Source: Technical note (dex1_1_service ced3216, xr_teleoperate 817fb00); Unitree support page §4" detail="PICO trigger → recording PC → rt/dex1/&lt;side&gt;/cmd → dex1_1_service → USB → RS-485-to-USB board → gripper. Proportional or binary mapping is a software choice; both to be tested." source="Technical note (dex1_1_service ced3216, xr_teleoperate 817fb00); Unitree support page §4" status="" id="n3">
