        <UserObject label="57 mm grip-span limit" tooltip="Controller-as-grip sets a floor: sleeve A is 56.9 mm across. With the recessed blade the span is about 54–64 mm, against an optimum of 45–55 mm; the squeeze trigger can only add to it. At 4:1, staying under the 50–60 N repetitive grip figure limits the carriage-side force to about 12–15 N (computed). Operator hand size unknown.&#xa;&#xa;Source: Fusion ASM copy-path v9; Lee et al. 2009 and ILO Encyclopaedia, both not in bib; vault PR #21" detail="Controller-as-grip sets a floor: sleeve A is 56.9 mm across. With the recessed blade the span is about 54–64 mm, against an optimum of 45–55 mm; the squeeze trigger can only add to it. At 4:1, staying under the 50–60 N repetitive grip figure limits the carriage-side force to about 12–15 N (computed). Operator hand size unknown." source="Fusion ASM copy-path v9; Lee et al. 2009 and ILO Encyclopaedia, both not in bib; vault PR #21" status="open" id="n44">
